[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n1_anselm"
text = "# DRAFT
# Anselm, the old porter, by the infirmary brazier at dusk (night 1). Blind, guilty and terrified: he hints, never tells.
# He wants to know the porter remembers his warning from the tour (d1_anselm_warned). If the tour was skipped, he gives it now.
# Hint: by the old porter who locked the guests in, he meant himself, and he didn't, every night.
== start
(The old porter sits by the brazier with a blanket round him. His white eyes are on the door before you're through it.)
Anselm: That's the porter's step. The keys give you away. I wore them thirty years.
-> warned [if d1_anselm_warned]
-> unwarned

== warned
(He listens to the room a moment, then leans toward you.)
Anselm: This morning, when we were alone. What I told you. You remember it?
-> ask

== ask
* [if not n1_anselm_bell] Don't let them in after the bell. -> bell
* [if not n1_anselm_locked] You said the old porter locked the guests in. -> locked
* [if not n1_anselm_why] Why? What happens after the bell? -> why

== bell [set n1_anselm_bell] [trust anselm 5]
(He lets out his breath.)
Anselm: Good lad. Say it over when they knock. Say it like a psalm.
-> ask

== locked [set n1_anselm_locked]
Anselm: I said the old porter. I meant me.
Anselm: I locked them in. Most nights. (He turns his face away.) Lock them in, porter. Every night.
-> ask

== why [set n1_anselm_why]
(His hand finds your sleeve and holds it.)
Anselm: Because I did. Don't ask me more. Not here.
-> ask

== unwarned [set n1_anselm_warned]
(He listens to the room a moment, then his hand finds your sleeve.)
Anselm: Don't let them in after the bell. Whatever they tell you.
Anselm: And lock the guesthouse at night. The old porter always did.
-> end

== again
(He turns his face toward you.)
Anselm: Still here? Go on to your supper. They'll notice if you're late.
-> ask [if d1_anselm_warned]
-> end

== leave
Anselm: After the bell, porter. Remember.
"
